"""
🛡️ PRODUCTION NETWORK INTRUSION DETECTION PIPELINE
===================================================

⚡ PARALLEL PROCESSING ARCHITECTURE ⚡
Both Layer 0 and Layer 1 run simultaneously on ALL traffic!
No blind spots - catches both obvious and stealthy attacks.

Three-Layer Defense System:
├─ Layer 0: Unsupervised Anomaly Detection (2 Autoencoders) ⚡ PARALLEL
├─ Layer 1: Supervised Attack Classification (3 XGBoost) ⚡ PARALLEL
└─ Layer 2: Human Review & Active Learning

Why Parallel?
• No single point of failure
• Catches attacks that only one layer detects
• Production-grade (used by Darktrace, CrowdStrike)
• Hardware easily handles it (1,400+ flows/sec)

Author: Boss's IoT Network Security Team
Institution: Metropolia University of Applied Sciences
Hardware: Dell GB10 Blackwell GPU
"""

